;; M4N slice 1 (docs/m4n-contract.md): acyclic negated reads of edited
;; input relations.  h is the canonical shape, hs adds a sibling negated
;; pair (the pairwise pre/post split), down is a positive reader of h so
;; negated repairs propagate through ordinary staged transitions.

table (a int)
table (b int)
table (c int)
table (h int)
table (hs int)
table (down int)

rule
(a X)
~(b X)
-->
(h X)

rule
(a X)
~(b X)
~(c X)
-->
(hs X)

rule
(h X)
-->
(down X)
